    "summary": "IBM invented the floppy disk in 1971 (8-inch); the 3.5-inch disk became standard, the 1.44 MB version shipping from 1986. Sony ended domestic sales of 3.5-inch floppies in March 2011, yet save icons still depict a floppy, a skeuomorph.",
